  "releaseNotes": "﻿### Added\n- Tests - Added generator and analyzer tests covering exception constructor generation and the missing-constructor analyzer\n### Changed\n- Dependencies - Updated FunFair.Test to 6.4.7.2960\n- Dependencies - Updated FunFair.Test.Source.Generator to 6.4.7.2960\n- Dependencies - Updated Nullable.Extended.Analyzer to 1.19.0\n- Tests - Test project now targets .NET 11 and enables runtime-async, so the test suite exercises the new runtime async behaviour\n- SDK - Updated DotNet SDK to 11.0.100\n- Dependencies - Updated Credfeto.Version.Information.Generator to 1.0.142.1766\n- Dependencies - Updated FunFair.CodeAnalysis to 7.2.25.2636\n- Dependencies - Updated Meziantou.Analyzer to 3.0.339\n- Dependencies - Updated Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.Analyzers to 5.12.0\n- Dependencies - Updated Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.CSharp to 5.12.0\n- Dependencies - Updated SonarAnalyzer.CSharp to 10.36.0.15337\n- Dependencies - Updated xunit.analyzers to 2.3.0\n- Dependencies - Updated xunit.v3 to 4.0.3\n- Source generator now uses the shared Credfeto.SourceGeneration.Helpers package for code emission, description-attribute lookup and diagnostic registration, so its behaviour is maintained in one place alongside other Credfeto generators",
